<p>1778 – half the Banda Islands’ nutmeg plantations were destroyed by a <span class="ielts-reading-question-item"><span class="ielts-inline-input-wrap"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">13</strong><input type="text" data-qnum="13" name="question_13" class="ielts-inline-input" placeholder="[13] javob..." autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false"></span></span></td>
