                                                                                                                                                            <h2 class="ielts-reading-question-section-heading">
                                            Questions 33-37                                                                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                    </h2>
                                        <div class="ielts-reading-question-section-content">
                                            <p>Look at the following statements and the list of explorers below.</p>
<p>Match each statement with the correct explorer, <strong>A-E</strong>.</p>
