                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            <div class="ielts-reading-question-item"> • <span>Tehrani rejects the idea that the useful lessons for life in fairy tales</span><span class="ielts-inline-select-wrap"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">28</strong><select data-qnum="28" name="question_28" class="ielts-inline-select"><option value="">[ 28 ] Tanlang...</option><option value="A. may be provided through methods used in biological research.">A. may be provided through methods used in biological research.</option><option value="B. are the reason for their survival.">B. are the reason for their survival.</option><option value="C. show considerable global variation.">C. show considerable global variation.</option><option value="D. contain animals which transform to become humans.">D. contain animals which transform to become humans.</option><option value="E. were originally spoken rather than written.">E. were originally spoken rather than written.</option><option value="F. have been developed without factual basis.">F. have been developed without factual basis.</option></select></span></di